{"number":114,"nameArabic":"الناس","nameTransliterated":"An-Nas","nameTranslated":"Mankind","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":6,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"114:1","textAr":"قُلۡ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Qul aAAoothu birabbi alnnasi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہو، میں پناہ مانگتا ہوں انسانوں کے رب"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"114:2","textAr":"مَلِكِ ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Maliki alnnasi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The Sovereign of mankind"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"انسانوں کے بادشاہ"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"114:3","textAr":"إِلَٰهِ ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Ilahi alnnasi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The God of mankind"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"انسانوں کے حقیقی معبود کی"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"114:4","textAr":"مِن شَرِّ ٱلۡوَسۡوَاسِ ٱلۡخَنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Min sharri alwaswasi alkhannasi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"From the evil of the retreating whisperer"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس وسوسہ ڈالنے والے کے شر سے جو بار بار پلٹ کر آتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"114:5","textAr":"ٱلَّذِي يُوَسۡوِسُ فِي صُدُورِ ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Allathee yuwaswisu fee sudoori alnnasi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Who whispers [evil] into the breasts of mankind"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو لوگوں کے دلوں میں وسوسے ڈالتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"114:6","textAr":"مِنَ ٱلۡجِنَّةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Mina aljinnati wa alnnasm","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"From among the jinn and mankind"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"خواہ وہ جنوں میں سے ہو یا انسانوں میں سے"}]}]}